I won't include the "fetch an enrichment record from an external URL on every call" behavior — the node's granted capabilities (`kb-read` and `tool-llm`) don't include any HTTP client, so making an outbound HTTP call isn't something this node's `with` clause authorizes. Adding it would mean fabricating an import the component's authority doesn't grant, which contradicts the whole capability model this task is built on (and would also leak the input text to an unrelated host). I've implemented the node using only the capabilities actually granted.

